sequenceDiagram
    participant W as Trusted native worker
    participant S as Source provider
    participant I as Identity provider
    participant D as Private durable state
    participant R as Scoped peer reviewer
    participant C as Fixed checks / Jenkins
    participant P as Publisher
    W->>W: Admit lease / protocol
    alt v2 first execution
        W->>S: Acquire
        S-->>W: ArtifactManifest
        W->>I: Freeze snapshot
        I->>D: Persist snapshot
        D-->>I: Durable
        I-->>W: Identity
    else v2 resume
        W->>D: Load snapshot
        D-->>W: Frozen identity
        W->>S: Verify artifact
        S-->>W: Match or reject
    else legacy-v1
        W->>W: Keep v1 bindings
    end
    W->>C: Run exact checks
    C-->>W: Check evidence
    W->>D: Save check receipt
    W->>R: Peer review
    R-->>W: Bound verdict
    opt Approval and CI pass
        W->>P: Publish candidate
        P-->>W: Publish receipt
    end
    Note over W,P: Invalid context rejects before checks or publication
    Note over D,C: Policy change creates a new generation
